BEGIN_DESC
Crash test. EMPU, speed limiter off, driver at the wheel, the charging station 700 m ahead on the runway. Hold Shift+W (about 130 km/h after 450 m) and steer with A/D into it; the platform drifts a little to the left on its own.
Check: wheel health (GEAR page), hull leak (LIFE page), the driver's injuries. The impact is logged in Orbiter.log.
END_DESC

